<title>USA: TCF Financial unit to redeem debentures.</title>
<headline>TCF Financial unit to redeem debentures.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>TCF Financial Corp said on Monday its Great Lakes National Bank Michigan subsidiary will redeem its remaining $7.1 million of 7.25 percent convertible subordinated debentures due 2011.</p>
<p>The debentures will be redeemed at par plus accrued and unpaid interest to the date of redemption.</p>
<p>The debentures are convertible into TCF stock at a price of $17.04 a share plus cash in lieu of fractional shares.</p>
<p>The deadline for conversion of the debentures is June 9.</p>
<p>	     -- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
